<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Champion Intl said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Champion Intl said raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Champion International Corp was raised to buy from hold on Tuesday at Prudential Securities, according to a source at the firm.</p>
<p>-- shaes of the paper and lumber company rose one to 57-5/8, a new 52-week high.</p>
